   167	- On PASS only, freeze the exact tested file as `candidates_wip/es6_<tag>/` with `main.py`, SHA-256/evidence, immutable copied inputs and this gate report; notify Claude using `bin/say claude`.  This creates no Kaggle submission and does not replace the promoted control without the required independent review.

